-- Press Left Alt to toggle. Type ;command [args] and press Enter.
-- Supported commands:
--   ;fly / ;unfly
--   ;antivc on|off
--   ;bring [username]  — bring all if no name
--   ;esp on|off
--   ;fullbright on|off
